It reads the OilFox tank sensors of the user's own account (FoxMobile app)
through the official FoxInsights Customer API
(https://github.com/foxinsights/customer-api, docs/v1), with the e-mail address
and the password of that account, within the fair use policy of FoxInsights
(one reading an hour). This integration is not affiliated with nor endorsed by
FoxInsights GmbH. OilFox is a trademark of its owner. The endpoints and fields
follow the published API documentation and the answers of the live API; the
example code of that repository (SSPL) was not used: no code is taken from it.
